1
00:00:04,690 --> 00:00:06,091
你 你还醒着吗
Are -- Are you awake?

2
00:00:06,140 --> 00:00:08,680
我大概两小时前睡了6分钟
I slept for six minutes two hours ago.

3
00:00:08,680 --> 00:00:10,480
我得去服一片安眠药
I'm gonna have to take a sleeping pill,

4
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,928
这意味着你得负责藏好我的车钥匙
which means you're gonna have to hide my car keys,

5
00:00:11,928 --> 00:00:13,163
电脑和乡村女歌手芮芭·麦克伊泰假发
laptop, and Reba McEntire wig.

6
00:00:13,660 --> 00:00:16,318
最近几天快把人折磨疯了
It's been a crazy couple days.

7
00:00:16,318 --> 00:00:17,880
昨天我发现我没得到
Uh, yesterday, I found out I didn't get

8
00:00:17,880 --> 00:00:20,620
我努力追求的大学橄榄球教练工作
the college football coaching job that I had been chasing.

9
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:22,087
我 我伤心欲绝
I was -- I was devastated.

10
00:00:22,087 --> 00:00:23,020
就在那之前片刻
And moments before that,

11
00:00:23,020 --> 00:00:25,140
我们收到曾经的领养机构打来的电话
we got a phone call from our old adoption agency

12
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:27,440
说我们有领养一个男孩的机会
with the opportunity for us to adopt a baby boy.

13
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,161
上帝关上一扇门
So, a door closes...

14
00:00:29,161 --> 00:00:31,680
就会给你打开一扇窗 但是 你该去应窗吗
A window opens. But do you answer it?

15
00:00:31,680 --> 00:00:33,400
没有"应窗"这个说法
You don't answer windows.

16
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:36,480
你一定开心死了吧 小卡说错话了呢
Well, how fun for you. Cam made a little mistake.

17
00:00:36,480 --> 00:00:40,600
我不断在脑海里列举这事的各种利弊
I keep making lists of all the pros and cons in my head.

18
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,606
婴儿身上的气味既算利也算弊
Uh, the -- the way a baby smells is on both.

19
00:00:42,606 --> 00:00:44,760
好吧 说说利项 开始
Okay, alright. Pros, go.

20
00:00:44,760 --> 00:00:47,642
好的 有个孩子让我们爱 孩子咯咯笑的声音
Okay, well, a baby to love. The sound of giggling.

21
00:00:47,642 --> 00:00:49,200
一个更大的家庭
You know, a bigger family,

22
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:52,140
等我们老了 就多个人来决定要不要拔管
an extra vote on whether to pull the plug on us when we get old.

23
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:54,240
我担心莉莉个性一触即发 手抖就拔
I'm worried that Lily has an itchy trigger finger.

24
00:00:54,240 --> 00:00:55,880
是啊 再养个孩子就能帮我们搞清楚
Yeah, and another child would help us figure out

25
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:57,540
莉莉的性格有多少是我们的问题
how much of Lily's personality is our fault

26
00:00:57,540 --> 00:00:58,316
有多少是她自身的问题
and what's on her.

27
00:00:58,316 --> 00:00:59,720
能沉冤昭雪真的挺好的
It would be nice to be vindicated.

28
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:01,840
再想想别的利项 圣诞节
Okay, other pros -- Christmases.

29
00:01:01,840 --> 00:01:05,100
将孩子的小脚趾第一次伸进海水里
Dipping little toes into the ocean for the first time,

30
00:01:05,142 --> 00:01:07,445
以及小宝宝穿着睡衣跑向门
the way a toddler run towards the door

31
00:01:07,445 --> 00:01:09,916
嘴里喊着"爹地"的小萌样儿
in their jammies saying, "Daddy!"

32
00:01:10,001 --> 00:01:11,300
你快说几个弊项敲醒我
Okay, you'd better hit me with some cons.

33
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:12,300
我简直快要排卵了
I'm practically ovulating.

34
00:01:12,300 --> 00:01:15,359
好吧 没有觉睡 车座要改 换尿布
Okay, no sleep, car seats, diapers,

35
00:01:15,359 --> 00:01:18,460
感冒咳嗽什么的 经常要去看医生
coughs and colds, all -- all the doctor's appointments,

36
00:01:18,460 --> 00:01:20,882
-塑料玩具扔得到处都是 -到处都是
- plastic toys everywhere. - Everywhere.

37
00:01:20,882 --> 00:01:22,434
我们家本来就已经太小了
Our -- Our place is already too small.

38
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,020
我们的卧室不够
We don't have enough bedrooms.

39
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:26,920
天啊 时间紧迫
Oh, God, the clock is ticking.

40
00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,580
我们只有半天时间就要给出答复了
We have half a day to give them an answer.

41
00:01:28,580 --> 00:01:29,960
好了 别胡思乱想了
Okay, you know what, no thinking.

42
00:01:29,960 --> 00:01:34,000
数到三 一起说要还是不要
On the count of three, say yes or no.

43
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:36,780
一 二 三
One, two, three...

44
00:01:38,021 --> 00:01:39,592
-我不知道 -我决定不了
- I don't know. - I can't decide!

45
00:01:53,880 --> 00:01:56,500
外面怎么有辆雪佛兰车 还有个司机在等着
Why is there a black Suburban outside with a driver?

46
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:58,080
是我们公司派来的
My company sent it.

47
00:01:58,080 --> 00:02:00,480
我要负责"希洛动力"
I'm manning the Helo Dynamics booth

48
00:02:00,480 --> 00:02:01,980
在加州理工学院的招聘会
for the job recruitment fair at Caltech.

49
00:02:02,840 --> 00:02:06,460
瞧瞧你 有巨型SUV和专职司机接驾呢
Look at you, being chauffeured in a giant SUV.

50
00:02:06,460 --> 00:02:09,320
我想象你开车的样子 是坐在丰田普锐斯车里哭
When I picture you driving, you're crying in a Prius.

51
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:11,320
别人给我开车 我的确哭得少些
I do cry less when I'm driven.

52
00:02:11,320 --> 00:02:13,560
你这身衣服也太正点了吧
And that outfit is on point.

53
00:02:13,560 --> 00:02:16,600
毕竟这对我来说是衣锦还乡 凯旋而归
Well, I mean, it's -- it's sort of a triumphant return for me.

54
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:19,800
我在那个大学辛辛苦苦念了四年 头发冒油懒得管
I spent four years there in sweats, with greasy hair,

55
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,480
一心只在乎成绩
caring only about grades.

56
00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:22,820
大家唯一一次注意到我
The only time anyone ever noticed me

57
00:02:22,820 --> 00:02:25,540
是我在期末考试周期间 焦虑到把眉毛都拔光了
was when I pulled out all my eyebrows during finals week.

58
00:02:25,540 --> 00:02:29,300
现在我有份好工作 住着奢华的公寓
Now I have a big job, swanky apartment,

59
00:02:29,300 --> 00:02:31,560
一双鞋的价钱比我第一个笔记本电脑还要贵
shoes that cost more than my first laptop...

60
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:33,200
简直就像是部浪漫喜剧
Oh, it's like a rom-com --

61
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:36,400
你离开时是个书呆子 归来时成了性感书呆子
you left a nerd and returned a hot nerd.

62
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,120
说到性感的人
Speaking of hot people,

63
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:40,120
或许我也应该去为我们诺普公司招些人
maybe I should go and recruit for NERP.

64
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:40,980
出于法律原因
For legal reasons,

65
00:02:40,980 --> 00:02:43,340
我们需要科学方面的人才来为产品背书
we need a science-y person to endorse product.

66
00:02:43,340 --> 00:02:45,760
毕竟我们这群大学没毕业的人
Considering we're all a bunch of people who didn't graduate college,

67
00:02:45,760 --> 00:02:47,940
卖的很多产品可是广被你们内服外用呢
we sell a lot of products that go inside of you.

68
00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:50,700
得了吧 不是这么个操作法
Yeah, no, it doesn't really work that way.

69
00:02:50,700 --> 00:02:52,238
首先 你必须获得邀请
A, you have to be invited,

70
00:02:52,238 --> 00:02:54,540
其次 稍微自重点的科学家
and B, no self-respecting scientist

71
00:02:54,540 --> 00:02:57,440
都不可能为你们公司售卖的智商税产品站台
is going to endorse the nonsense your company is pushing.

72
00:02:57,440 --> 00:02:59,780
瞎说什么呢 我们出品的含铜牙膏
Excuse me, but our copper-infused toothpaste

73
00:02:59,780 --> 00:03:03,460
位列食品药品管理局的重点"监督"产品前十呢
is on the FDA's top ten items to watch, so...

74
00:03:03,460 --> 00:03:06,900
菲尔 你能过来一下吗
Phil! Phil, can you come in here?

75
00:03:06,900 --> 00:03:10,560
我为视频面试准备了一小段演讲展示
I've worked up a little presentation for my Skype interview,

76
00:03:10,560 --> 00:03:11,980
我希望听听你的意见反馈
and I would love to get your feedback.

77
00:03:11,980 --> 00:03:13,300
好啊 来吧
Yes, please!

78
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:15,901
我的魔术表演你一直都很捧场
You've been such a cheerleader for me with all my magic shows

79
00:03:15,901 --> 00:03:18,060
包括南加房宴 我也很乐意支持你
and SCARB dinners, I'd love to be yours.

80
00:03:18,060 --> 00:03:18,940
来吧
Hit it.

81
00:03:18,940 --> 00:03:20,960
我必须这就打住你
I'm gonna stop you right there.

82
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:23,861
我已经好几个月没工作了
I've been out of work for a few months,

83
00:03:23,861 --> 00:03:25,520
我变得有点惴惴不安
and I've gotten kinda antsy.

84
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:29,060
为排遣焦虑 我试过打扫卫生 整理物品
To channel my anxiety, I have cleaned, I have organized.

85
00:03:29,060 --> 00:03:31,040
或许有点强迫症的程度
Perhaps a bit obsessively.

86
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:32,199
甚至去看了医生
Doctors were consulted.

87
00:03:32,199 --> 00:03:34,640
就一个 心理治疗师而已 甚至不是真正的医生
One -- a therapist, so not even a real doctor.

88
00:03:34,640 --> 00:03:36,520
但很快就停药了
But meds were quickly dismissed.

89
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,880
我们不想要性欲方面的副作用
We didn't want the sexual side effects.

90
00:03:38,880 --> 00:03:39,640
总之呢
Anyway...

91
00:03:39,640 --> 00:03:43,400
我打算将我的焦虑转变成事业
I am going to channel my anxiety into a career.

92
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,960
我即将面试我的梦想工作
I am interviewing for my dream job --

93
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:51,023
我最爱的整理连锁店"收纳良品"的高级副总裁
Senior VP of my favorite organizing chain store, organize 'Em!

94
00:03:51,023 --> 00:03:52,422
我太激动了 我可能会拥有一份整理...
I'm so excited, I could have an organaz--

95
00:03:52,422 --> 00:03:53,477
你不至于堕落到这地步
You're better than that.

96
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:57,760
所以在整个面试过程中
So, throughout the call,

97
00:03:57,760 --> 00:04:00,160
我会一直提到这个整理系统
I'm gonna be referring to this organizational system

98
00:04:03,324 --> 00:04:05,251
-聪明 -是啊 瞧好了
- Smart. - Yeah. Watch.

99
00:04:05,767 --> 00:04:08,055
贝克曼女士 这观点可真有趣
Oh, Ms. Beckman, what an interesting point.

100
00:04:08,055 --> 00:04:10,751
我应该记下来
I should jot that down.

101
00:04:17,818 --> 00:04:19,046
那是什么鬼声音
What the hell is that?

102
00:04:21,060 --> 00:04:22,520
天啊 什么
Oh, my God. What?

103
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:25,840
对了 我忘了告诉你你爸过来给我帮忙
Oh, yeah, I forgot to tell you, your dad came over to help me.

104
00:04:25,840 --> 00:04:26,936
我打算把楼梯修好
I gotta fix that step.

105
00:04:26,936 --> 00:04:28,120
它裂开了
It splintered.

106
00:04:28,120 --> 00:04:30,380
我早上没踩稳 结果就脑袋着地了
I wiped out this morning and landed on my head.

107
00:04:30,380 --> 00:04:31,180
好吧 但我得面试啊
Yeah, but my call.

108
00:04:31,180 --> 00:04:33,819
我们必须赶紧修好 否则有人会受伤的
We gotta take care of that before someone gets hurt.

109
00:04:33,819 --> 00:04:34,700
已经有人受伤了
Someone did.

110
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:36,560
万一是海莉抱着孩子摔了怎么办 或者迪兰
I mean, what if it was Haley with the babies? Or Dylan?

111
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:38,380
-或者... -或者我 我都摔吐了
- Or...? - Or me. I threw up.

112
00:04:38,380 --> 00:04:41,321
我的天 昨天歌洛莉亚还是穿着高跟鞋来的
Holy Moses. Gloria was here yesterday in heels.

113
00:04:41,321 --> 00:04:42,540
她也可能会摔得很惨的
That could've been ugly.

114
00:04:42,540 --> 00:04:43,680
我昏昏欲睡
I'm sleepy.

115
00:04:43,680 --> 00:04:46,060
小子 你得挪开 不然你会把别人绊倒的
Buddy, you gotta move. Someone's gonna trip over you.

116
00:04:46,060 --> 00:04:48,203
各位 你们不能现在干这事 明白吗
Hey, guys, we can't do this right now, okay?

117
00:04:48,203 --> 00:04:50,460
我1:23时有个面试
I've got -- I've got an interview at 1:23.

118
00:04:50,460 --> 00:04:51,800
这时间定得好具体
Well, that's specific.

119
00:04:51,800 --> 00:04:53,400
不 对奥黛丽·贝克曼来说不算什么
No, not for Audrey Beckman.

120
00:04:53,400 --> 00:04:55,800
她的整个人生 安排都精确到秒
Her whole life is scheduled down to the second.

121
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,700
她简直是强迫症人群的神
She's a god to OCD people.

122
00:04:57,700 --> 00:04:59,100
不然你以为我什么要买那个保险杠贴纸
Why do you think I've got that bumper sticker

123
00:04:59,100 --> 00:05:01,760
上面写着"像贝克曼一样井井有条"
that says "Straighten It Like Beckman"?

124
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:03,056
我现在能下来了吗
Can I come down now?

125
00:05:03,056 --> 00:05:05,480
如果宝宝们醒来时 我没准备好奶瓶
If I don't have the babies' bottles when they wake up,

126
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,020
他们就会发脾气
they're mean.

127
00:05:06,020 --> 00:05:08,400
你还没遇到"可怕的两岁期"呢
You're not even in the terrible twos yet.

128
00:05:08,400 --> 00:05:09,880
那是什么时候开始啊
Oh, when do those start?

129
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,540
好了 就快到时间点了
Okay, look, it's almost time.

130
00:05:11,540 --> 00:05:13,420
拜托 别弄出任何噪音
Just please, nobody make any noise,

131
00:05:13,420 --> 00:05:14,680
任何人都不准进那间办公室
nobody go in that office.

132
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,460
我现在做好了完全的准备
I have all my ducks in a row.

133
00:05:16,460 --> 00:05:18,190
我先上楼换个衣服就好
I'm just gonna run upstairs and change my shirt.

134
00:05:18,190 --> 00:05:18,833
好吧 但是小心点
Oh, okay, but be careful.

135
00:05:18,833 --> 00:05:19,822
我知道自己在干什么 我没问题的
I know what I'm doing, I have got this.

136
00:05:20,316 --> 00:05:20,960
要命了 老天爷啊
Oh, boy! Oh, God!

137
00:05:20,960 --> 00:05:24,800
我的腿卡在里面了
My leg is stuck!

138
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,020
谁快想想办法啊
Somebody do something!

139
00:05:26,020 --> 00:05:27,980
我很擅长取下卡住的戒指
I'm really good at getting rings off.

140
00:05:27,980 --> 00:05:29,560
你想让我给你大腿涂黄油做润滑吗
Do you want me to butter your thighs?

141
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:32,240
迪伦 有时我喜欢把话先在心里过一遍
Hey, Dylan, sometimes I like to play things out

142
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,020
看没有歧义再说出口
in my head first, if that's helpful.

143
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:39,320
亲爱的 我们想和你说个事
Hey, honey, uh, we need to talk to you about something.

144
00:05:39,320 --> 00:05:40,952
宝贝 这是件大事
Sweetie, this is something pretty big,

145
00:05:40,952 --> 00:05:41,670
我希望你做好心理准备
and I -- I want you to brace yourself.

146
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:45,900
领养机构联系了我们...
The adoption agency called --

147
00:05:45,900 --> 00:05:47,039
我死也不回去
I'm not going back!

148
00:05:47,039 --> 00:05:50,160
你知道软弱有特权的孩子在岘港会有什么下场吗
Do you know what happens to soft, entitled kids in Da Nang?

149
00:05:50,160 --> 00:05:54,240
不不不 不是的
No, no, no, no, no, no! No, no.

150
00:05:54,240 --> 00:05:54,260
不是的
N-No. No.

151
00:05:54,260 --> 00:05:55,620
有一个男婴...
There's a baby boy --

152
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:58,640
我觉得你们应该收养他
I think you should do it.

153
00:05:58,657 --> 00:06:00,040
-真的吗 你这么轻易就同意了 -什么
- Really? Just -- Just like that? - What?

154
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,260
只要我去朋友家过夜时能让你们不再来看 什么都行
Whatever stops you dropping by my sleepovers.

155
00:06:02,260 --> 00:06:04,255
你们对我过度关注了
You guys are way too focused on me.

156
00:06:04,255 --> 00:06:06,680
再说 有个弟弟会很欢乐的
Plus, I think it'd be fun to have a baby brother.

157
00:06:06,680 --> 00:06:07,340
虽然...
Although...

158
00:06:07,340 --> 00:06:09,040
虽然什么
Although what?

159
00:06:09,040 --> 00:06:11,480
你们现在养娃不会太老了吗
Aren't you guys kind of old to be having a baby?

160
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:14,020
我马上要进入夜夜笙歌的青少年时期
I'm getting into the juicy part of my teen years.

161
00:06:14,020 --> 00:06:15,860
万一你们死了 我可不想接手带娃
I don't want to have to take over for you.

162
00:06:15,860 --> 00:06:18,160
我们也没那么老好吗
Okay, we are not that old.

163
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,019
你们都50高寿了
You're like 50.

164
00:06:19,019 --> 00:06:20,862
什么鬼 当然没有
Oh, my God! No!

165
00:06:21,080 --> 00:06:23,340
小爸才44岁 我48岁
Daddy's 44, and I'm 48.

166
00:06:23,340 --> 00:06:26,080
你们知道等宝宝上高三时
You do realize when the baby's a senior in high school,

167
00:06:26,080 --> 00:06:27,819
你们就是拿养老金的长者了吧
you guys will be senior citizens?

168
00:06:27,819 --> 00:06:29,619
我们才不是长...
We will not be senior c--

169
00:06:29,619 --> 00:06:31,655
-小卡 -66
- Cam. - Sixty-six.

170
00:06:31,655 --> 00:06:32,760
到时我66岁
I'll be sixty-six.

171
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:33,731
我就是61岁
And I'll be sixty-one.

172
00:06:33,731 --> 00:06:34,560
是62啦
Well, sixty-two.

173
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:37,700
没到六月生日不算啦
Not until June!

174
00:06:38,780 --> 00:06:42,140
没用啊 我的腿还紧紧卡在里面
It's not working! My leg is really stuck in there!

175
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:44,100
也许该再考虑下我的提议了
It might be time to return to my idea.

176
00:06:44,100 --> 00:06:45,580
我绝不会砍掉我的腿
I'm not cutting my leg off.

177
00:06:45,580 --> 00:06:47,980
想想装上一条机械腿后 你会跑得多快啊
Think about how fast you would run with a robot leg.

178
00:06:47,980 --> 00:06:50,380
卢克 你妈妈怎么可能装一条机械腿
Luke, your mom's not getting a robot leg!

179
00:06:50,478 --> 00:06:52,634
她应该装两条 不然她跑起来只会绕圈
She'd need two, or she'd just run in circles.

180
00:06:52,634 --> 00:06:53,814
好了 我们该看看楼梯下面
Come on, let's check under the stairs.

181
00:06:53,814 --> 00:06:55,482
没错 拜托了 快点
Yes, please, and hurry!

182
00:06:55,736 --> 00:06:57,423
这房子怎么回事
What the hell's the matter with this house?

183
00:06:57,960 --> 00:07:00,820
怎么会坏掉两级楼梯
How could two steps be broken?

184
00:07:03,595 --> 00:07:06,601
天啊 湿气好重 我头发都要变卷了
My God, the humidity. My hair's gonna frizz out.

185
00:07:06,601 --> 00:07:08,560
所以我从来不给别人看我在越南的照片
That's why I never show any pictures from 'Nam.

186
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:10,740
糟了 我把给菇木装的加湿器
Oh, no, I totally forgot about the humidifier

187
00:07:10,740 --> 00:07:12,280
忘得一干二净了
for my mushroom log.

188
00:07:12,280 --> 00:07:14,747
它需要阴暗和潮湿环境
It needed darkness and moisture.

189
00:07:14,747 --> 00:07:15,707
一定是腐蚀了木头
It must have rotted the wood.

190
00:07:17,100 --> 00:07:21,440
老婆 你真的卡得死死的
Wow, honey, you're really wedged in here tight.

191
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:22,460
是啊 没在开玩笑的
Yeah, no kidding.

192
00:07:22,460 --> 00:07:25,220
你为什么不能像个正常人一样
Why can't you buy your mushrooms at a store,

193
00:07:25,220 --> 00:07:26,700
直接从商店买蘑菇
like a normal person?

194
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:27,720
店里买的蘑菇
Store-bought mushrooms?

195
00:07:27,720 --> 00:07:30,580
你这婴儿潮一代和我这代之间真的有代沟
You really don't get my generation, Boomer.

196
00:07:30,771 --> 00:07:32,223
也许这样能让你顿悟
Maybe this'll enlighten you.

197
00:07:32,540 --> 00:07:33,360
张嘴
Open up.

198
00:07:33,360 --> 00:07:34,221
把你的脏手拿开
Get your hand away from my --

199
00:07:34,221 --> 00:07:35,423
张嘴啦
Open up!

200
00:07:39,199 --> 00:07:40,212
真特么好吃
That's damn good.

201
00:07:40,666 --> 00:07:42,729
我为什么总是拒绝尝试新事物
Why do I always default to "No"?

202
00:07:42,729 --> 00:07:46,164
歌洛莉亚是对的吗 我该尝试修身牛仔裤吗
Is Gloria right? Should I try slim-cut jeans?

203
00:07:46,760 --> 00:07:49,192
下面是怎么回事啊
Guys! What's going on down there?!

204
00:07:49,192 --> 00:07:51,760
你的脚卡在两条水管之间
Your foot's stuck between two copper pipes.

205
00:07:51,760 --> 00:07:53,480
我们得把水管锯开
We're gonna have to cut it.

206
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,540
可能需要一些时间
It might take a while.

207
00:07:54,540 --> 00:07:56,060
我等不了
I don't have a while!

208
00:07:56,237 --> 00:07:58,920
真不敢相信 我要错过面试了
I can't believe this. I'm going to miss my interview.

209
00:07:58,920 --> 00:08:00,740
这可是我的梦想工作啊
And this was my dream job!

210
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:03,080
我本来能收纳好整个世界
I was gonna get to organize the whole world.

211
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:05,460
现在一切都只能保持混乱的原状
And now everything is gonna stay so messy.

212
00:08:05,460 --> 00:08:06,800
你不能重新约个时间吗
Can't you just reschedule it?

213
00:08:06,800 --> 00:08:09,120
不行 菲尔 那我会像个不靠谱的鸽王
No! Phil, I'd look like a flake!

214
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,840
这可是收纳公司
This is an organizational company,

215
00:08:10,840 --> 00:08:12,860
不像你们房产界那么懒散随意
not the loosey-goosey world of real estate,

216
00:08:12,915 --> 00:08:14,980
你们都只会说"中午十二点到三点见
where everything's "See you noon to three,

217
00:08:14,980 --> 00:08:16,700
我会带曲奇来"
and I'll bring the cookies"!

218
00:08:17,044 --> 00:08:18,347
抱歉 我拿你撒气了
Sorry. I'm lashing out.

219
00:08:18,347 --> 00:08:19,640
没关系 狮子不会因为绵羊的看法
No, it's okay. The lion doesn't lose sleep

220
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:20,860
而辗转失眠
over the opinions of sheep.

221
00:08:20,860 --> 00:08:23,160
宝贝 你就在那里接电话呗
Honey, just take the call from there.

222
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:26,238
我在楼梯上接电话看起来会多荒唐啊
How ridiculous would I look taking a call on stairs?

223
00:08:26,238 --> 00:08:28,760
再说 我需要那些架子 因为我已经精心
Plus, I need my shelves, 'cause I had this whole thing

224
00:08:28,760 --> 00:08:30,360
摆好了各种产品还有...
worked out with the products and --

225
00:08:30,360 --> 00:08:31,380
你不需要搞这些噱头
You don't need gimmicks!

226
00:08:31,564 --> 00:08:35,180
你曾是普利契特衣柜的牛逼CEO
You were the C.E.O. for Pritchett's freakin' Closets.

227
00:08:35,180 --> 00:08:36,920
你知道有多少人能说这句话吗
You know how many people can say that?

228
00:08:36,920 --> 00:08:38,100
只有我和你
Me and you!

229
00:08:38,100 --> 00:08:39,820
还有玛格丽特 我每五年
And Margaret every five years,

230
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:41,580
去做结肠镜检查时 都交给她代班
when I went under for my colonoscopy.

231
00:08:42,840 --> 00:08:44,300
好吧 把电话给我
Fine. Give me my phone.

232
00:08:44,300 --> 00:08:47,520
我就在这里搞砸我的面试
I'll bomb the interview from right here.

233
00:08:47,520 --> 00:08:50,880
她失去自信了 她需要那些架子
She's lost her confidence. She needs those shelves.

234
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,840
其实 如果她去不了办公室
You know what, if she can't get to the office,

235
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,620
我们可以把办公室搬到她旁边
we can bring the office to her.

236
00:08:54,620 --> 00:08:58,000
你在盯着看
You're staring.

237
00:08:58,000 --> 00:09:00,180
我头发炸毛了 对不对
I'm frizzing, aren't I?

238
00:09:00,180 --> 00:09:04,420
我必须承认 走进那校园
I've got to admit, walking onto that campus...

239
00:09:04,420 --> 00:09:07,040
那么多人注视着我 崇拜我
All those eyes on me, the adoration...

240
00:09:07,040 --> 00:09:09,120
感觉很好 感觉这是对的
It felt good. It felt right.

241
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:12,660
感觉我得到的这些待遇都是应得的
Like I had earned everything that was coming my way.

242
00:09:12,660 --> 00:09:13,800
你烂透了
You suck!

243
00:09:13,800 --> 00:09:17,100
不 就是你
No! You!

244
00:09:17,100 --> 00:09:17,780
什么
What?

245
00:09:17,780 --> 00:09:20,240
希洛动力超邪恶
Helo Dynamics is evil!

246
00:09:20,240 --> 00:09:22,240
你说什么 我们帮助别人
Excuse me? We help people.

247
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:25,700
是啊 帮那些法西斯分子 独裁者 寡头
Yeah! People like fascists, dictators, oligarchs.

248
00:09:25,700 --> 00:09:26,960
你在说什么啊
What are you talking about?

249
00:09:26,960 --> 00:09:28,720
我们不过是制造能检测
We make things like facial scanners

250
00:09:28,720 --> 00:09:31,051
遗传病倾向的面部扫描仪
that detect predisposition to genetic diseases.

251
00:09:31,051 --> 00:09:32,236
残暴政府就用这个来
Which oppressive governments use

252
00:09:32,236 --> 00:09:34,297
识别持不同政见者
to identify political dissidents.

253
00:09:34,780 --> 00:09:38,960
但这也能用在视频聊天里
Well, I mean, it's also used on video chats

254
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,400
把你自己变成独角兽啊
to turn yourself into a unicorn.

255
00:09:40,400 --> 00:09:41,637
还有比这更好玩的吗
Name one thing more fun!

256
00:09:41,637 --> 00:09:45,040
穿着你的名牌高跟鞋滚出去 见钱眼开的垃圾
Why don't you walk your fancy shoes outta here, you sellout?!

257
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:46,920
为什么有个穿凉鞋还配袜子的土逼
Why is someone wearing socks and sandals

258
00:09:46,920 --> 00:09:48,330
在辱骂你绝美的高跟鞋
yelling at your fabulous shoes?

259
00:09:48,330 --> 00:09:49,511
-见利忘义 -我不知道
- Sellout! - I don't know!

260
00:09:49,700 --> 00:09:50,919
再说你怎么会在这里
And what are you doing here?

261
00:09:50,919 --> 00:09:52,274
我来为诺普招人啊
Well, I'm recruiting for NERP.

262
00:09:52,274 --> 00:09:54,080
我说过我需要一个搞科学的人
I told you I need a science-y person.

263
00:09:54,080 --> 00:09:56,700
你不能自己进来闲逛 你得有入场证
You can't just saunter in here. You have to be approved.

264
00:09:56,700 --> 00:09:59,240
年轻人 我看你不修边幅 你一定很聪明
Oh. Hey, kid. You don't care what you look lik. You must be smart.

265
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,860
你想去一个有很多辣妹的地方上班吗
Want to work at a place that has a lot of hot girls?

266
00:10:00,860 --> 00:10:01,600
别闹了
Stop it!

267
00:10:01,600 --> 00:10:04,180
你还能把情况弄得更糟吗
Could you make this horrible situation any worse?

268
00:10:04,180 --> 00:10:07,860
抵制希洛 赶紧滚吧
Hell no, Helo! It's time you go!

269
00:10:07,860 --> 00:10:11,240
-那不是我干的 -抵制希洛 赶紧滚吧
- I didn't do that. - Hell no, Helo, it's time you go!

270
00:10:11,580 --> 00:10:13,300
我以前从没见过这样成群的书呆
I've never seen nerds swarm like this before!

271
00:10:13,300 --> 00:10:15,540
我们通常不是群聚型的生物
We're not typically a clustering people.

272
00:10:15,540 --> 00:10:16,743
天啊 是阿尔文
Oh, my God. It's Arvin.

273
00:10:16,822 --> 00:10:18,716
糟了 我发邮件告诉他我会来
Oh, no. I emailed him I'd be here.

274
00:10:18,716 --> 00:10:20,900
我等下要尴尬死了
Oh, this is gonna be so awkward for me!

275
00:10:20,900 --> 00:10:23,080
我们最后一次见面时 我伤透了他的心
The last time I saw him, I broke his heart.

276
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,220
你还尴尬
Awkward for you?

277
00:10:24,220 --> 00:10:26,940
这些人都恨我恨到不惜彼此眼神交会了
These people hate me so much, they're making eye contact!

278
00:10:26,940 --> 00:10:29,280
艾丽克丝 你好啊
Alex? Hi!

279
00:10:29,827 --> 00:10:31,767
那些人在干嘛
What's all the com--

280
00:10:32,080 --> 00:10:32,700
海莉
Haley.

281
00:10:32,700 --> 00:10:33,960
阿尔文 你好
Arvin. Hi.

282
00:10:33,960 --> 00:10:35,340
我不知道你会在这
I didn't know you'd be here.

283
00:10:35,340 --> 00:10:37,240
这句话很难说出口
This isn't going to be easy to say.

284
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:39,120
我结婚了 生了双胞胎
I got married, and I have twins.

285
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:40,380
是的 我知道
I know. Yes.

286
00:10:40,380 --> 00:10:43,080
那是迪兰节假日新闻邮件的头条
It was the lead story in Dylan's holiday newsletter.

287
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:45,280
你确定你没偷偷跟进我的现状吗
You sure you haven't been stalking a little?

288
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:48,180
没有 有新闻邮件就行了
No. No, that's why.

289
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:50,980
艾丽克斯 这是针对你的吗
Alex, is this directed at you?

290
00:10:50,980 --> 00:10:52,920
是的 没错
Yes. Yes, it is.

291
00:10:52,920 --> 00:10:55,300
他们太刻薄了
And they are so mean!

292
00:10:55,300 --> 00:10:56,567
抵制希洛
Hell no, Helo!

293
00:10:56,567 --> 00:10:57,518
打断一下
Uh, excuse me.

294
00:10:57,548 --> 00:11:01,340
你们都知道我人很好 对吧
Uh, you-you all know I'm a cool guy, right?

295
00:11:01,340 --> 00:11:03,000
你们叫我阿尔文我也不介意
I'm chill with you calling me Arvin.

296
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:07,101
有一次我们还去室外上课
We had class outside that one time.

297
00:11:07,101 --> 00:11:08,580
大家先暂停一分钟好吗
Will you just give us a minute?

298
00:11:08,580 --> 00:11:12,360
我保证 她会全身心感受到我的愤怒
I assure you, she will feel the full effects of my rage.

299
00:11:13,965 --> 00:11:15,379
-你最近怎么样 -不怎么样
- So, how have you been? - Not so great.

300
00:11:15,379 --> 00:11:17,060
他们不喜欢你的老板吗
They're not fans of your employer?

301
00:11:17,060 --> 00:11:19,040
这太不公平了
Which is so unfair!

302
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:21,340
我正在做非常前沿的研究
I'm doing very advanced research

303
00:11:21,340 --> 00:11:23,053
很可能会产生深远的影响
that could have far-reaching implications.

304
00:11:23,053 --> 00:11:24,440
是啊 我毫不意外
Yeah. Of course you are.

305
00:11:24,440 --> 00:11:25,040
等一下
One sec.

306
00:11:25,040 --> 00:11:27,200
你晚上怎么睡得着
How do you sleep at night?!

307
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:29,000
你也和他们一样吗
Okay, so, you, too?

308
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:29,900
当然不是
No, of course not.

309
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:32,640
我不是来评判你或你的老板
I am not here to judge you or your boss --

310
00:11:32,640 --> 00:11:33,680
撒旦
Satan!

311
00:11:33,680 --> 00:11:38,500
总之 我只是想路过打个招呼
Anyway, I just thoht I'd drop by and say a quick hello.

312
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:39,900
海莉 很高兴见到你
Haley, lovely to see you.

313
00:11:39,900 --> 00:11:41,200
别迷恋我了 向前看吧
You have to move on.

314
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:44,120
艾丽克斯 祝你一切都好 那好
Alex, I wish you nothing but the best. Okay.

315
00:11:44,120 --> 00:11:46,400
好了 大伙 带点感情
Right, guys. Now with feeling.

316
00:11:46,725 --> 00:11:50,179
抵制希洛 赶紧滚吧
Hell no, Helo! It's time you go!

317
00:11:50,179 --> 00:11:53,440
抵制希洛 赶紧滚吧
Hell no, Helo! It's time you go!

318
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,400
莉莉的话真的让我们很在意
What Lily said really got to us.

319
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,840
或许我们这年纪确实不该要宝宝了
Maybe we are too old to have a new baby.

320
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,940
昨天 我发现自己耳朵上长毛了
Yesterday, I found hairs on my ears

321
00:11:59,940 --> 00:12:01,440
还对着本地新闻大骂
and I yelled at the local news.

322
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:03,940
我把宋飞说成了"宋灰"
And I called Seinfeld "Steinfeld."

323
00:12:03,940 --> 00:12:06,020
不过话说回来
You know, but on the other hand,

324
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:08,480
我们这年纪的男人要孩子也挺常见的
there are a lot of men our age having babies.

325
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:11,220
是的 不过他们都有第二任娇妻和保姆
Yes, but-but they have second wives and nannies --

326
00:12:11,220 --> 00:12:12,798
保姆和娇妻通常是一个人
who are often the same person.

327
00:12:12,798 --> 00:12:15,100
我们需要跟一个
We just needed to talk to a-a parent

328
00:12:15,100 --> 00:12:17,400
上年纪后要宝宝的家长聊聊
that had a baby when they were old.

329
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:20,200
你们肯定搞错了 因为我生乔时才35
You must be mistaken, because I had Joe when I was 35.

330
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:22,420
不 我记得 你当时已经...
No, I remember. You had just turned --

331
00:12:22,420 --> 00:12:23,479
她不会承认的
She's not gonna budge.

332
00:12:23,479 --> 00:12:26,140
就跟我们直说吧 有多难
Okay, j-just tell us, how hard is it?

333
00:12:26,140 --> 00:12:28,780
会不会经常没有觉睡
Well, are there nights where you don't sleep

334
00:12:28,780 --> 00:12:30,280
恨不得杀了自己
and you want to kill yourself?

335
00:12:30,280 --> 00:12:31,340
当然会
Of course.

336
00:12:31,340 --> 00:12:33,600
每次抱起放下宝宝时
Are there shooting pains in your back

337
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:36,740
后背会不会疼得要死
from picking the baby and putting him down?

338
00:12:36,740 --> 00:12:38,160
每次都会
Constantly.

339
00:12:38,160 --> 00:12:40,060
好吧 有转折[臀部]吗
Okay, well, is there a but?

340
00:12:40,060 --> 00:12:42,200
还算能看 跟以前没法比
It's hanging in there, but it's not the same.

341
00:12:42,200 --> 00:12:45,440
我知道你们担心自己太老了
Look, I know that you guys worry that you're too old

342
00:12:45,440 --> 00:12:49,060
反应太慢了 照顾不好宝宝
or too slow to have a baby at this age.

343
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:51,340
但你猜怎么着
But guess what.

344
00:12:51,340 --> 00:12:52,440
你们可以
You can!

345
00:12:52,440 --> 00:12:55,660
-那是什么鬼 -一个娃娃
- What the hell was that? - A doll.

346
00:12:55,660 --> 00:12:59,320
它本该证明你们准备好了要宝宝
It was supposed to prove that you guys were ready to have a baby,

347
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:02,660
但假如这是真的宝宝 你们已经摔死它了
but if this was a real one, you would have killed it.

348
00:13:02,660 --> 00:13:05,140
难道不是该怪你乱扔宝宝吗
Well, wouldn't it be your fault for throwing it?

349
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:07,341
你就饶了我吧 我只是在实验新招
Give me a break. I was trying something.

350
00:13:07,341 --> 00:13:09,340
我正在想办法卖这间房
I'm in the middle of selling a house.

351
00:13:09,340 --> 00:13:10,920
对了 顺带一提 房子很漂亮
Oh, yeah, it's very cute, by the way.

352
00:13:10,920 --> 00:13:12,120
有几间卧室
How many bedrooms is it?

353
00:13:12,120 --> 00:13:13,160
三间带一个小屋
Three and a den.

354
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,520
比我们家卧室多
Oh, that's one more than we have.

355
00:13:14,520 --> 00:13:15,860
米奇尔 这房子真不错
Mitchell, this house, huh?

356
00:13:15,860 --> 00:13:17,820
小卡 我根本不能开始考虑买房
Cam, I can't even begin to think about a house

357
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:20,071
我们甚至还没决定好
when we haven't even made a decision about whether or not

358
00:13:20,071 --> 00:13:21,520
-要不要领养 -或许这是老天的暗示
- we're going to -- - But maybe it's a sign.

359
00:13:21,520 --> 00:13:23,640
新工作泡汤了 新宝宝要来了
You know, the new job goes away, a baby comes along,

360
00:13:23,640 --> 00:13:25,020
突然间 我们身处这幢迷人的
and all of a sudden, we're standing in a charming

361
00:13:25,020 --> 00:13:27,020
-三卧房子 -还有三间半洗手间
- three-bedroom -- - Three and a half bath.

362
00:13:27,020 --> 00:13:29,362
老天爷 只要我们换回开架护肤霜
Which, holy cow, we could afford if we just switch back

363
00:13:29,362 --> 00:13:30,680
-我们就买得起 -不行
- to grocery store face cream. - No.

364
00:13:30,680 --> 00:13:33,060
这里可是好学区房
And it's in a great school district.

365
00:13:33,060 --> 00:13:34,398
你知道吗 她说得没错
You know what? She's right about that.

366
00:13:34,398 --> 00:13:35,494
他们有全职护士
They have a full-time nurse.

367
00:13:35,494 --> 00:13:37,931
我们只有一盒创可贴和一罐姜汁汽水
We have a Band-Aid jar and a can of ginger ale.

368
00:13:37,931 --> 00:13:39,560
我们手上的难题已经够多了
Okay, we already have too much on our plate.

369
00:13:39,560 --> 00:13:41,080
我们不能买这幢房
We're not buying this house!

370
00:13:41,080 --> 00:13:43,760
地下室还有唱K室
Oh, and in the basement, they have a karaoke room

371
00:13:43,760 --> 00:13:45,941
专为那些想要模仿天后
for people that want to impersonate divas

372
00:13:45,941 --> 00:13:48,371
又不想被老爸看到的人准备
without their fathers seeing them.

373
00:13:49,284 --> 00:13:50,897
我想看看也无妨
Well, I guess it wouldn't hurt to look.

374
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:57,400
我说不好 我真的看起来像在办公室吗
I don't know, guys. Does it really look like I'm in my office?

375
00:13:57,400 --> 00:13:58,660
《大白鲨》也不是真鲨鱼
Jaws wasn't a real shark,

376
00:13:58,660 --> 00:14:01,000
还是吓得我好几个月不敢坐马桶
but I still wouldn't sit on a toilet seat for months.

377
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:02,820
这角度怎么样 妈
How's this angle, Mom?

378
00:14:03,289 --> 00:14:05,020
应该可以
Um, uh, fine, I guess.

379
00:14:05,020 --> 00:14:07,800
我的脸颊好痒 我脸上有东西吗
My cheek is itching! Is there something on my face?

380
00:14:07,800 --> 00:14:10,820
你怎么变成外星人了 你这是怎么了
Admiral Ackbar, what the hell happened to you?

381
00:14:10,820 --> 00:14:12,480
肯定是你的破蘑菇害的
I'll bet it was your stupid mushrooms!

382
00:14:12,480 --> 00:14:13,960
我为什么要尝试新事物
Why do I try new things?

383
00:14:13,960 --> 00:14:16,180
我不会换掉我的老爹牛仔裤
I'm sticking to my Brett Favre jeans!

384
00:14:16,180 --> 00:14:18,240
老天 是她 是她
Oh, God! That's her! That's her!

385
00:14:18,240 --> 00:14:19,340
所有人安静
Everybody quiet!

386
00:14:19,340 --> 00:14:20,359
等等 我得上去喂宝宝
Wait, I have to get up there with the babies --

387
00:14:20,359 --> 00:14:21,220
你坐下
Sit!

388
00:14:23,086 --> 00:14:24,400
贝克曼女士
Hi, Ms. Beckman.

389
00:14:24,400 --> 00:14:26,480
非常感谢你给我这次...
Thank you so much for this --

390
00:14:26,480 --> 00:14:29,240
机会
...opportunity.

391
00:14:29,252 --> 00:14:31,083
不客气
You're welcome.

392
00:14:32,430 --> 00:14:33,920
我不是在笑话你
I-I wasn't mocking you.

393
00:14:33,920 --> 00:14:35,520
只不过每次我听到有人打喷嚏
It's just that whenever I hear someone sneeze,

394
00:14:35,520 --> 00:14:38,100
我也必须打喷嚏 让它变成偶数
I have to sneeze, too, so that it's an even number.

395
00:14:38,100 --> 00:14:39,520
这是很正常的
It's-it's perfectly normal.

396
00:14:39,520 --> 00:14:41,440
是的 我完全理解
Oh, no, I completely understand.

397
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:44,660
几年前 有次从淋浴间出来时
A few years ago, I forgot to tap the towel rod twice

398
00:14:44,660 --> 00:14:45,700
我忘了敲两下毛巾杆
when I got out of the shower,

399
00:14:45,700 --> 00:14:48,220
结果乔治·迈克尔在那天离世了 所以
and we lost George Michael that day, so...

400
00:14:48,220 --> 00:14:49,800
是你害的啊
That was you?

401
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:52,280
让我为你介绍一下我们的公司
Let me tell you a little bit about our company.

402
00:14:52,780 --> 00:14:54,060
洗耳恭听
I'd love that.

403
00:14:54,060 --> 00:14:57,120
但首先 让我记些笔记
But first, I'd like to take some notes.

404
00:14:57,940 --> 00:14:58,817
往上抬
Tilt up!

405
00:14:58,817 --> 00:15:01,120
这就是我喜欢这个行业的原因
That's what I love about this industry --

406
00:15:01,120 --> 00:15:03,219
从不无聊 保持"尖峰"
never a "Dull" Moment.

407
00:15:03,219 --> 00:15:04,759
没插电
It's not plugged in.

408
00:15:09,306 --> 00:15:11,280
我们对收纳良品的定位是
We like to think of "Organize 'Em"

409
00:15:11,280 --> 00:15:13,260
一家关于健康的公司
as a wellness company --

410
00:15:13,960 --> 00:15:17,600
一家关于正念的公司
A mindfulness company.

411
00:15:18,643 --> 00:15:19,552
你的架子在晃吗
Are your shelv shaking?

412
00:15:20,012 --> 00:15:21,190
是的
Uh...yeah.

413
00:15:21,360 --> 00:15:23,520
是的 好像发生了小地震
Yeah, I think we're having a little earthquake.

414
00:15:23,520 --> 00:15:25,100
不如这样 不如让我
You know what? Why don't I tell you

415
00:15:25,100 --> 00:15:27,140
向你介绍一下自己
a little something about myself?

416
00:15:27,140 --> 00:15:30,680
我认为我是那种
I like to think I'm the kind of person

417
00:15:30,680 --> 00:15:34,020
能看出顾客的消费趋势朝哪倾斜
who can see where the consumer trends are leaning,

418
00:15:34,020 --> 00:15:36,400
做出快速调整
adjust quickly,

419
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:38,980
然后向反方向倾斜回来的人
and lean back the other direction.

420
00:15:38,980 --> 00:15:42,740
我的天
Oh, my God!

421
00:15:42,740 --> 00:15:45,440
我太喜欢整理了
Do I love organizing!

422
00:15:45,440 --> 00:15:47,724
宝贝 我爱死了
Baby, do I love it!

423
00:15:47,724 --> 00:15:49,748
邓菲女士 你喝酒了吗
M-Ms. Dunphy, have you been drinking?

424
00:15:50,040 --> 00:15:52,214
说谎就行了 她闻不到你一身酒气
Just lie. She can't smell your breath.

425
00:15:52,214 --> 00:15:52,698
不可以 茵素 不可以
No, Poppy, no!

426
00:15:54,560 --> 00:16:01,700
这他妈是在搞什么鬼
What the hell is happening?!

427
00:16:01,700 --> 00:16:03,260
我放弃了
I'm calling it.

428
00:16:03,604 --> 00:16:06,200
抱歉 贝克曼女士 这真是个馊主意
I'm sorry, Ms. Beckman. This was a terrible idea.

429
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,680
我... 好吧
I -- Okay.

430
00:16:07,680 --> 00:16:11,000
我踩破了一格楼梯 我的脚卡住了
I fell through a step, and my leg is stuck.

431
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:14,740
请听我说 你们是我最想要为之奋斗的公司了
And listen, there's no company I would rather work for.

432
00:16:14,740 --> 00:16:17,580
我不想跟你取消 所以我请我的家人
I didn't want to cancel on you, so I asked my family

433
00:16:17,580 --> 00:16:21,700
把这里布置得像我在办公室里
to make it look like this was my office.

434
00:16:21,700 --> 00:16:24,484
杰·普里契特 柜界先锋 不过估计你早听说过我
Jay Pritchett, closeteer, but you probably know that.

435
00:16:25,925 --> 00:16:29,034
能把他赶离我的听觉范围内吗
Could you just please get him out of my ear shot?

436
00:16:29,340 --> 00:16:31,160
好的好的 没问题
Yeah, yeah, sure.

437
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:34,160
相信我 我本来很想让你以为
Listen, I wanted you to think that I was a person

438
00:16:34,160 --> 00:16:35,940
我是一个井然有序又成功的人 但我并不是
who had it all together, but I'm not.

439
00:16:35,940 --> 00:16:38,280
现实就是我住在一片混乱之中
The reality is I live in chaos!

440
00:16:38,280 --> 00:16:40,400
这就是为什么我这么爱你们的产品
But that's why I love your products.

441
00:16:40,400 --> 00:16:42,178
每当... 我的孩子们吵架
When -- When my kids are fighting

442
00:16:42,178 --> 00:16:43,820
或者我的孙子女们在哭闹
or -- or the grandkids are crying

443
00:16:43,820 --> 00:16:47,180
又或是我丈夫跳着弹簧高跷做松饼
or my husband is making pancakes on a pogo stick,

444
00:16:47,180 --> 00:16:50,080
我心里知道我可以去到我的办公室
I know that I can go into my office

445
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:53,440
把各类账单按颜色标记归档
and file bills in a color-coded divider

446
00:16:53,440 --> 00:16:56,080
享受到片刻心灵的宁静
and experience one moment of peace.

447
00:16:56,080 --> 00:16:59,620
我知道你们公司有多需要我
I know I'm what your company needs,

448
00:16:59,620 --> 00:17:02,740
就像我知道我有多需要你们公司
because I know how much I need your company.

449
00:17:02,740 --> 00:17:08,260
我得到工作了
I got the job!

450
00:17:08,260 --> 00:17:10,040
她真是太棒了
I'm so proud of her!

451
00:17:10,040 --> 00:17:11,880
我猜那肯定是我们的幸运阶梯
I guess it's our lucky step.

452
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:16,340
不用担心 摔的是我
Don't worry. It's just me.

453
00:17:16,340 --> 00:17:17,541
看有多幸运
Oh. See?!

454
00:17:21,700 --> 00:17:24,220
你知道吗 你也可以为我说两句的啊
You know what? You could have defended me!

455
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:25,443
我该说话吗
Mm. Should I have?

456
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,360
难道你同意他们说的话吗
Are you saying you agree with them?

457
00:17:27,360 --> 00:17:29,340
我觉得他们的口号过于简化了
I found their chant rather simplistic.

458
00:17:29,340 --> 00:17:31,941
如果是我 我估计会说像是...
You know, I would have probably gone with something like...

459
00:17:31,941 --> 00:17:34,440
"希洛动力公司这家跨国企业
"Helo Dynamics is a multinational corporation

460
00:17:34,440 --> 00:17:37,300
只在乎利益而忽视道德"
that prioritizes profits over ethics."

461
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:39,620
我就知道 你也对我有意见
I knew it. You are judging me.

462
00:17:39,620 --> 00:17:42,140
你这么批判你所有学生吗
Do you judge all of your students like this?

463
00:17:42,140 --> 00:17:42,760
艾丽克斯
Alex...

464
00:17:42,760 --> 00:17:46,800
我其他的学生并没有你的潜力
all my students don't have the potential you do!

465
00:17:46,899 --> 00:17:48,040
你是如此的不凡
You were extraordinary!

466
00:17:48,040 --> 00:17:50,920
你本来应该成为改变世界的人
You were meant to change the world!

467
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:53,737
而且这并不是我一个人的想法
And it's not just me that thinks it.

468
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:55,780
迪兰的家庭新闻邮件里也写了
Dylan said so in his newsletter.

469
00:17:55,780 --> 00:17:57,180
饶了我吧
Oh, spare me.

470
00:17:57,180 --> 00:17:59,820
道貌岸然的学者鄙视得意门生
The sanctimonious academic, looking down on the star pupil

471
00:17:59,820 --> 00:18:02,080
就因为她脚踏千金名鞋
because of her thousand-dollar shoes!

472
00:18:02,080 --> 00:18:04,122
那双鞋价值上千吗
Those shoes were a thousand dollars?

473
00:18:04,122 --> 00:18:06,340
哇靠 价格是买鞋附赠一整村子的药物吗
Damn it. Do they come with medicine for a village?

474
00:18:06,340 --> 00:18:08,300
告诉你 我也不想说这话
You know what? I hate to say it,

475
00:18:08,300 --> 00:18:11,280
但我不需要你的认可 因为我喜欢我的工作
but I don't need your approval, because I love what I do.

476
00:18:11,280 --> 00:18:13,700
那真是太遗憾了
Ah. Well, I am sorry to hear that.

477
00:18:13,700 --> 00:18:16,962
-省省吧 -我遗憾是因为我在组织研究团队
- Don't be. - I'm sorry because I am assembling a research team

478
00:18:16,962 --> 00:18:19,160
想要创造无所不能的人工智慧
to create A.I. capable of everything

479
00:18:19,160 --> 00:18:21,820
从发现外太空的系外行星
from discovering exoplanets in deep space

480
00:18:21,820 --> 00:18:24,142
到人体中疾病的生物标记物
to biomarkers of disease in humans.

481
00:18:24,142 --> 00:18:28,195
本来如果有你的加入
And you would've been a superb addition

482
00:18:28,240 --> 00:18:30,260
可以让团队如虎添翼
to an exceptional team.

483
00:18:30,260 --> 00:18:32,380
但拉倒吧
But pbht!

484
00:18:32,380 --> 00:18:33,220
教授
Well, Professor...

485
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:35,700
你特么可以把这工作
you can take that job...

486
00:18:35,700 --> 00:18:37,860
乖乖交给我
and give it to me.

487
00:18:37,860 --> 00:18:39,940
不过你得付我在原公司的薪水
But I'm going to need you to match my salary!

488
00:18:39,940 --> 00:18:41,440
我不确定我们团队有没有那经费
I'm not sure we have that kind of money.

489
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,600
成交
Deal.

490
00:18:42,600 --> 00:18:45,930
我去看看我还能不能拿回去退钱
I'm gonna go see if I can still return these.

491
00:18:48,100 --> 00:18:51,140
最后来到这美丽的家庭休息区
And finally, back to the beautiful family room.

492
00:18:51,140 --> 00:18:51,520
很棒啊
It's great.

493
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:53,100
这里很美啊
I mean, it is beautiful.

494
00:18:53,100 --> 00:18:54,260
我仿佛都能看见
I can see you both

495
00:18:54,260 --> 00:18:57,285
你们在这里发生的各种美丽误会了
having a delightful misunderstanding here.

496
00:18:57,285 --> 00:18:58,660
米奇尔 听我说
Okay, now, Mitchell. Hmm?

497
00:18:58,660 --> 00:19:01,520
你知道我这个人很少冲动
You know I'm not usually impulsive --

498
00:19:01,520 --> 00:19:03,620
少来了 你独自去超市买东西时
Please. You never go to the grocery store alone

499
00:19:03,620 --> 00:19:04,859
就没有没带气球回家过
and not come home with a balloon.

500
00:19:04,859 --> 00:19:06,920
但楼上的浴室真的太棒了
But that bathroom upstairs is amazing.

501
00:19:06,920 --> 00:19:09,920
是啊 我... 我也很喜欢我能有独自洗脸台
Yeah, and I -- I do love the idea of me having my own sink.

502
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:12,540
我们家的打扫阿姨终于可以知道是谁脏乱了
Our housekeeper would finally realize who the real villain is.

503
00:19:12,540 --> 00:19:13,880
行 所以我们应... 应该就下手啊
Okay, so we should -- we should do it!

504
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:15,040
我们点头吧
Let's do it!

505
00:19:15,040 --> 00:19:16,980
-买下这房子吗 -对啊
- Buy this house? - Yeah.

506
00:19:16,980 --> 00:19:19,260
我们连要不要再领养都还没决定呢
We haven't even made a decision about the baby yet.

507
00:19:19,260 --> 00:19:22,640
另一个中介给我发消息了
Oh. Another broker just sent me a text.

508
00:19:22,640 --> 00:19:24,980
有人6点要出价了
An offer is coming at six o'clock.

509
00:19:24,980 --> 00:19:26,680
这下好了 又一个倒计时
Great. Another ticking clock.

510
00:19:26,680 --> 00:19:28,520
干脆就一边解除一个定时炸弹
